<title>CANADA: Alberta Agriculture details harvest progress.</title>
<headline>Alberta Agriculture details harvest progress.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alberta Agriculture on Tuesday detailed the level of progress to Sept 15.</p>
<p>CROPS	   SWATHED (PCT)  COMBINED (PCT)  YIELD (bu/ac)</p>
<p>HRS Wheat	45		 37		  38.2</p>
<p>Winter Wheat  100		 99		  38.5</p>
<p>SWS Wheat	70		 66		  55.0</p>
<p>Oats	     47		 38		  71.2</p>
<p>Barley	   62		 51		  56.8</p>
<p>Fall Rye	100		 94		  43.7</p>
<p>Peas	     82		 67		  35.7</p>
<p>Flax	     79		 73		  17.0</p>
<p>Canola	   82		 47		  21.4</p>
<p>-- Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548</p>
</text>
